  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "beat-01",
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "One appointment. One date. Can you finish it using only a keyboard?",
      "file": "beat-01.wav",
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 4.96,
      "audio_samples": 119040,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 9.338,
      "sha256": "bf4aec99d0e694d419564b7498055ff6384781f1d7777d44e5ca5251185843ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-02",
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "You press Tab. Focus skips the date control. The page loads, but the booking is still blocked.",
      "file": "beat-02.wav",
      "start_seconds": 5.14,
      "end_seconds": 12.5,
      "audio_samples": 176640,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 14.582,
      "sha256": "299414a80b38bf0c4498fccc6b64eba3acaf09e97b71199b74ac623a1727c2c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-03",
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "This is AccessFinish. It helps developers review an AI source repair, then check whether the intended task actually succeeds.",
      "file": "beat-03.wav",
      "start_seconds": 12.68,
      "end_seconds": 20.76,
      "audio_samples": 193920,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 15.076,
      "sha256": "1fc9ad718794dc393dd844734a05c8e9fe1f5841982906a2de9ef369df0e7adc"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-04",
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "For this guided Easy!Appointments case, we supplied the diagnosis and repair direction.",
      "file": "beat-04.wav",
      "start_seconds": 20.94,
      "end_seconds": 27.26,
      "audio_samples": 151680,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 11.961,
      "sha256": "8e1941966bb3196e01d90e09cf0454c496cb5cea9d012efcdf4f57afb8f638bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-05",
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super, running on Nebius Token Factory, proposed five source edits. The request and response are retained.",
      "file": "beat-05.wav",
      "start_seconds": 27.34,
      "end_seconds": 36.3,
      "audio_samples": 215040,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 16.923,
      "sha256": "737fc880e95067d3830a15412b629caee5ff5cf0b53617e10b563124dcd87693"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-06",
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "First, inspect the change. The date control becomes keyboard editable. Calendar refreshes must preserve the typed date.",
      "file": "beat-06.wav",
      "start_seconds": 36.48,
      "end_seconds": 44.96,
      "audio_samples": 203520,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 18.834,
      "sha256": "1fad4d2691e0e29ad759e5267c53d1a8cce914e66db17c04fe900b2097ca8d2d"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-07",
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "Approval is bound to this exact patch hash.",
      "file": "beat-07.wav",
      "start_seconds": 45.04,
      "end_seconds": 48.08,
      "audio_samples": 72960,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 5.977,
      "sha256": "a79db4275e05b23c6b8373f9f8bb1565d114d7f32e8b9ac7956d3a27c2544b38"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-08",
      "paragraph": 6,
      "text": "Then execute the recorded proposal in a fresh, isolated fixture. Build the application. Complete the keyboard booking.",
      "file": "beat-08.wav",
      "start_seconds": 48.26,
      "end_seconds": 56.5,
      "audio_samples": 197760,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 20.611,
      "sha256": "72e9090061b84d6e06417aea366a64920ecdbc4ea0ed37c411ee4c41da0c129a"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-09",
      "paragraph": 6,
      "text": "Check storage through a separate read-only database reader. Reopen the appointment in a fresh browser.",
      "file": "beat-09.wav",
      "start_seconds": 56.58,
      "end_seconds": 63.06,
      "audio_samples": 155520,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 12.298,
      "sha256": "c02b52af1df6ccf3dc39c07bdbdd931c943601c2824155143ec9f32540d82af1"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-10",
      "paragraph": 7,
      "text": "Here is the payoff. November 2, 2026. Nine to nine thirty, Riyadh time. The expected booking was saved and independently reopened.",
      "file": "beat-10.wav",
      "start_seconds": 63.24,
      "end_seconds": 74.36,
      "audio_samples": 266880,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 20.869,
      "sha256": "73eeab73f82fad90b2efed34c1f72ab18622bd77c7906da38e980068b4044f4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-11",
      "paragraph": 7,
      "text": "Existing data and the regression controls also passed.",
      "file": "beat-11.wav",
      "start_seconds": 74.44,
      "end_seconds": 78.68,
      "audio_samples": 101760,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 9.021,
      "sha256": "3d37fef3a7436b1086618ccd46fc579deb46fa2b6bfa8522f64e760731d54894"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-12",
      "paragraph": 8,
      "text": "But a convincing patch is not enough. Another attempt completed the keyboard task, then failed the calendar control.",
      "file": "beat-12.wav",
      "start_seconds": 78.86,
      "end_seconds": 86.78,
      "audio_samples": 190080,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 17.644,
      "sha256": "21eb29d425dcf22ba74cae08f252583cc519ceb90191a5463b62ba389ccc7b0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-13",
      "paragraph": 8,
      "text": "AccessFinish rejected it.",
      "file": "beat-13.wav",
      "start_seconds": 86.86,
      "end_seconds": 88.78,
      "audio_samples": 46080,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 4.217,
      "sha256": "815ae27515d9eca6cda623afd84274b6f616092ef7288d5dc2e9e053e6070c5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-14",
      "paragraph": 9,
      "text": "Across five frozen attempts on this one guided case, two passed completely. Two failed to build. One failed a regression check.",
      "file": "beat-14.wav",
      "start_seconds": 88.96,
      "end_seconds": 98.16,
      "audio_samples": 220800,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 21.031,
      "sha256": "e9133b2efb8daf512f5abf3c701fa46e76c561cbc99954d2edeea86f168acec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-15",
      "paragraph": 9,
      "text": "Every failure is retained. Broader repair accuracy and screen-reader validation remain open.",
      "file": "beat-15.wav",
      "start_seconds": 98.24,
      "end_seconds": 104.88,
      "audio_samples": 159360,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 13.537,
      "sha256": "03868f62d0d4199c7c5fcb22722993dff194eee083d2cfd4ee850ce4c53be860"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-16",
      "paragraph": 10,
      "text": "For developers and accessibility QA, the question is simple: did the user finish the task, with the right data?",
      "file": "beat-16.wav",
      "start_seconds": 105.06,
      "end_seconds": 112.42,
      "audio_samples": 176640,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "generation_seconds": 14.992,
      "sha256": "9ce6b876f9111aaaeb7b73c054f19c4e137160467c41c1cef856fd6f1c8823a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "beat-17",
      "paragraph": 11,
      "text": "AccessFinish. Review the repair. Verify the outcome.",
      "file": "beat-17.wav",
      "start_seconds": 112.6,
      "end_seconds": 117.0,
